OL,5,G2200 Play for Today: Big Winners
OL,6,     FA multi-million pound winning
OL,7,     Flottery ticket provokes 53 years
OL,8,     Fof suppressed emotions in a
OL,9,     Frelationship to crash to the
OL,10,     Fsurface. Sue Johnston and Paul
OL,11,     FCopley star in this devastating
OL,12,     Ftwo hander.
OL,13,G2300 Taggart
OL,14,     FWith Matt Burke newly at the helm,
OL,15,     Ftensions are rife amongst the
OL,16,     Fteam. Reid isn't happy when she's
OL,17,     Fsidelined onto a missing person's
OL,18,     Fcase, but then a body is found.
