OL,5,G0105 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe police question Vera about the
OL,7,     Frobbery but say they're unlikely
OL,8,     Fto be able to help her. Jacki
OL,9,     Fisn't pleased with the newspaper
OL,10,     Farticle about her case.
OL,11,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FBea tells the women to keep quiet
OL,13,     Fabout Jacki's relationship with
OL,14,     FJim or risk having her transferred
OL,15,     Fto Barnhurst. A reporter arrives,
OL,16,     Flooking for an angle on Jacki's
OL,17,     Fstory.
